# More barks: trades at work, places, ages, regions.

scene bk2_fish_cry
when topic=bark a.job=fisher time=dawn|day
a : Fresh from the water! | Eel! Pike! Trout! | Catch of the day, cheap!

scene bk2_smith_work
when topic=bark a.job=smith
a : Hot iron! Stand back! | Another hinge, another penny. | Where did I put my tongs?

scene bk2_baker_work
when topic=bark a.job=baker
a : Bread's out! | Mind the oven! | Who wants a warm loaf?

scene bk2_healer
when topic=bark a.job=healer
a : Keep it clean, I said! | Next! Who's next? | Willow bark for fever, mint for the belly.

scene bk2_carter
when topic=bark a.job=carter
a : Gee up! | Clear the road! | Whoa, steady, steady.

scene bk2_innkeeper
when topic=bark a.job=innkeeper
a : Rooms! Rooms for the night! | Hot stew! | Last orders soon!

scene bk2_miner
when topic=bark a.job=miner
a : Mind the shaft! | Another day under the hill. | Lamp oil. Need lamp oil.

scene bk2_sailor
when topic=bark a.job=sailor
a : Heave away! | Wind's turning. | Coil that rope properly!

scene bk2_priest
when topic=bark a.job=priest
a : All are welcome inside. | The bell rings at dusk for prayers. | Peace be with you.

scene bk2_beggar
when topic=bark a.job=beggar
a : Spare a penny? | Bless you, bless you. | Anything at all, friend?

scene bk2_noble
when topic=bark a.job=noble
a : Out of my way. | Where is my steward? | Insufferable heat.

scene bk2_servant
when topic=bark a.job=servant
a : Coming, coming! | Mind the polish! | So much to do.

scene bk2_laborer
when topic=bark a.job=laborer
a : One more load. | My back, my back. | Who's next?

scene bk2_scholar
when topic=bark a.job=scholar
a : Where did I put that page? | Fascinating. Simply fascinating. | Quiet, please. I'm reading.

scene bk2_adolescent
when topic=bark a.stage=adolescent
a : This place is so boring. | Race you! | I'm not a pup any more!

scene bk2_young_play
when topic=bark a.stage=young
a : Tag! You're it! | Look, a frog! | Wait for me!

scene bk2_old_mutter
when topic=bark a.stage=old
a : Kids today. | Where are my spectacles? | Back in my day...

scene bk2_gate
when topic=bark place=gate
a : Halt there! | Next cart! | Toll's a penny a wheel!

scene bk2_chapel
when topic=bark place=chapel
a : Quiet, please. | The Saint watches. | Light a candle, friend.

scene bk2_home
when topic=bark place=home
a : Who left the door open? | Supper's nearly ready. | Wipe your feet!

scene bk2_field
when topic=bark place=field
a : Get on, beast! | Another row. | Rain or shine.

scene bk2_shore
when topic=bark place=shore
a : Mind the tide! | Net's caught again. | Gulls! Get off!

scene bk2_barracks
when topic=bark place=barracks
a : Fall in! | Who took my boots? | Lights out at the bell.

scene bk2_wild
when topic=bark place=wild
a : Long way yet. | Keep your eyes on the trees. | Quiet out here.

scene bk2_rain_coast
when topic=bark region=rain_coast
a : Rain, rain, always rain. | Smell of tar and fish. | Ship's in!

scene bk2_marches
when topic=bark region=marches
a : By the Saint, it's hot! | Grapes! Fresh grapes! | Mind the steps!

scene bk2_accord
when topic=bark region=accord
a : Cold up here! | The Concord sits tonight. | Make way for the Warden!

scene bk2_downs
when topic=bark region=downs
a : Sheep everywhere. | Wind off the downs! | Market day soon.

scene bk2_lake
when topic=bark region=lake
a : Fish on the jetty! | Mist on the mere again. | Boat's coming in!

scene bk2_fens
when topic=bark region=fens
a : Mind the bog! | Peat for the fire! | Don't follow the lights!

scene bk2_steppe
when topic=bark region=steppe
a : No rain again. | Grain! Grain for sale! | Dust everywhere.

scene bk2_fortress
when topic=bark region=fortresses
a : Wall's quiet. | Change the watch! | Cold stone, cold food.

scene bk2_fog
when topic=bark weather=fog
a : Can't see a thing. | Who's there? | Mind the fog.

scene bk2_storm
when topic=bark weather=storm
a : Get inside! | Listen to that thunder! | Batten the shutters!

scene bk2_overcast
when topic=bark weather=overcast
a : Grey day. | Might rain. | Sun's hiding.

scene bk2_market_day
when topic=bark day=market
a : Market day! Bargains! | Stalls are full! | Come and buy!
